# Motanka's files live in /opt/motanka by design (DESIGN.md, "Linux
# practices: Filesystem layout"), so they never shadow a host package.
dir-or-file-in-opt
# The fonts stay out of /usr/share/fonts on purpose: only the Motanka
# session's fontconfig file lists /opt/motanka/share/fonts, so no other
# session sees them (requirement 5). Motanka's package names start with
# "motanka-", not "fonts-" (DESIGN.md, rule 1).
font-outside-font-dir
font-in-non-font-package
